### Finding 9: CDN-01 — Stale Minified Builds in Tracker Distribution Directory
- **Location:** `tracker/dist/aura.min.js`, `tracker/dist/banner.min.js` vs `tracker/src/`
- **Status:** **CRITICAL DEPLOYMENT DEFECT**
